OL,3,GNEWSAHotel to give away 1,500 items of
OL,4,Afurniture
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Liverpool hotel is donating about
OL,7,F1,500 items of furniture to charities
OL,8,Fas part of a multi-million pound
OL,9,Frefurbishment.
OL,11,FMattresses, bedside tables, sofas and
OL,12,Flighting from all 216 rooms and suites
OL,13,Fat the Pullman Liverpool are being
OL,14,Freplaced.
OL,16,FGeneral manager Stephen Rycroft said he
OL,17,Fhoped to find new homes for the items
OL,18,Fand save them from landfill.
OL,20,FItems from the hotel are being offered
OL,21,Fto charitable organisations across the
OL,22,FLiverpool City Region.
